      "type": "intro",
      "text": "Products & Leads\n\nThe Products & Leads API allows LFIs to publish their banking product catalogue and to receive customer leads forwarded by TPPs. Customers browse products in the TPP application and either apply directly via a channel the LFI configures (redirect URI, phone, email, or written instructions), or request follow-up contact — in which case the API Hub forwards the lead and the LFI follows up within 30 days.",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "Products & Leads",
        "source_repo": "community-standards",
        "source_file": "src/pages/tech/lfi-api-hub/v2.1/banking/products-and-leads/index.vue",
        "parser": "vue-sfc"
      }
    },
    {
