      "document_id": "tech/lfi-api-hub/v2.1/banking/products-and-leads",
      "type": "section",
      "text": "Products & Leads > Bank Data Sharing Provider\n\nAccess to the Products & Leads API requires TPPs to hold the BDSP role. The API Hub validates the role on every request before proxying it to the LFI.",
